Hi Arthur,

I think I figured it out. In the for loop building the nexus file, it calls:

for (i in 1:nInd(x)) {
        cat(paste0(poplabels[i], "_", indlabels[i]))
        cat("  ")
        cat(m[i, ], sep = "")   This is calling the original matrix, not the data frame that has been sorted by population.
        cat("\n")
    }

I'll try and rewrite it now.

Cheers,

Renee

